8Q3IcHCFMoDA",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["來小松拉麵用餐好幾次了，每一次的用餐體驗都很好！\n\n店內採用機器自助點餐，操作簡單又有趣，對第一次來的客人也很友善。用餐環境明亮、乾淨，座位數不少，即使兩個人來用餐也不會有擁擠或被趕著吃完的壓力。\n\n這次點了豚骨拉麵和辣味拉麵，兩種湯頭風味完全不同，但都很濃郁順口。豚骨湯頭香濃不膩，辣味拉麵則多了層次感和香氣，加上蒜泥後更是加分。麵條屬於細麵，保有麵心口感，搭配叉燒、竹筍和溏心蛋，整體表現相當不錯。\n\n價格親民、份量也很足夠，可以免費加麵一次，CP值很高，很適合學生和附近上班族。\n\n不過最讓人印象深刻的其實是店家的溫暖，今天下午突然下起大雷雨，我們不知道店家14:30休息，一直待到14:40左右邊聊天邊等雨小一點。發現佔用到店家休息時間後，沒想到店家不但沒有催促，還貼心地跟我們說等雨小一點再走，離開時甚至借我們雨傘，真的讓人感受到滿滿的人情味。\n\n有些店讓人記住是因為餐點好吃，而有些店則是因為溫暖的服務讓人想再次回訪。小松拉麵剛好兩者都有。\n\n推薦給喜歡拉麵、正在找板橋美食或新埔站附近美食的朋友！",null,[0,98]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/10241835355923173233/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRvVWxwclZreE9TR1I1VTBjMWFsb3pSbUZPTVRsYVZFWTRORm95WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10241835355923173233/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRvVWxwclZreE9TR1I1VTBjMWFsb3pSbUZPTVRsYVZFWTRORm95WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/10241835355923173233/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRvVWxwclZreE9TR1I1VTBjMWFsb3pSbUZPTVRsYVZFWTRORm95WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10241835355923173233/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRvVWxwclZreE9TR1I1VTBjMWFsb3pSbUZPTVRsYVZFWTRORm95WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/10241835355923173233/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRvVWxwclZreE9TR1I1VTBjMWFsb3pSbUZPTVRsYVZFWTRORm95WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10241835355923173233/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRvVWxwclZreE9TR1I1VTBjMWFsb3pSbUZPTVRsYVZFWTRORm95WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,4162,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2toUlprVkxOSGR5U0c1alozRmFOMTlaVEY4NFoyYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1416a8b22162b54d!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkhRZkVLNHdySG5jZ3FaN19ZTF84Z2c